  "description": "Full-color, short-run custom printed folding cartons.",
  "notesHtml": "<p><strong>Custom folding cartons</strong>: We offer high-quality, fully custom folding cartons. Minimum order is 50 boxes, with no die charge and free setup. You can order any in-between size not listed in the size table. The price is that of the next larger size that fits your size.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Need a larger size or quantity not listed?</strong> For larger sizes, larger quantities or thicker stock, contact the factory for a quote. We can produce folding cartons up to 40pt thick and in larger sizes not listed here. Finishes such as embossing and debossing, aqueous coating, UV coating and foil stamping can also be added.</p>",
  "specs": {
    "features": [
      "Free setup, art and logos",
      "Bleeds allowed on all sides",
      "No die charge on standard sizes",
      "No overrun charge",
      "No pre-fixed sizes",
      "Made in USA"
    ],
    "materials": [
      "U5520 - 5524: 11.4pt gloss cover"
    ],
